# Cropper

A movable, resizable crop region with image gestures and canvas export.

<Example {source} title="Cropper">
	<Demo />
</Example>

## Props

All optional props without a default remain `undefined`. `class` accepts Svelte `ClassValue`; `style` is a CSS string.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `settings` | `E & { [K in keyof CropperSettingProps]?: never }` | `undefined` |
| `src` | `string` \| `null` | `undefined` |
| `canvas` | `boolean` | `true` |
| `checkOrientation` | `boolean` | `true` |
| `crossOrigin` | `boolean` \| `'anonymous'` \| `'use-credentials'` | `true` (anonymous) |
| `unloadTime` | `number` | `500` ms |
| `autoReconcileState` | `boolean` | `true` |
| `disabled` | `boolean` | `false` |
| `class` | `ClassValue` | `undefined` |
| `style` | `string` | `undefined` |
| `children` | `Snippet` | Default `RectangleStencil` |
| `moveImage` | `boolean` \| `MoveImageOptions` | `true` |
| `scaleImage` | `boolean` \| `ScaleImageOptions` | `true` |
| `rotateImage` | `boolean` \| `RotateImageOptions` | `false` |
| `stencilConstraints` | `StencilConstraints<E>` | `defaultStencilConstraints` |
| `wrapper` | `Snippet<[CropperWrapperSnippetProps<E>]>` | `CropperWrapper` |
| `boundary` | `Snippet<[CropperBoundarySnippetProps<E>]>` | `StretchableBoundary` |
| `backgroundWrapper` | `Snippet<[CropperBackgroundWrapperSnippetProps<E>]>` | `CropperBackgroundWrapper` |
| `background` | `Snippet<[CropperBackgroundSnippetProps<E>]>` | `CropperBackgroundImage` |

Built-in settings are flat props. `settings` accepts only extension fields and excludes every built-in setting key.

## Built-in settings

The indexed types below are the exact public setting types, including value-or-function alternatives. [Settings and defaults](/docs/core/settings) expands their behavior.

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `transformImage` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['transformImage']` | `{ adjustStencil: true }` |
| `moveCoordinates` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['moveCoordinates']` | `undefined`; no modifier override |
| `resizeCoordinates` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['resizeCoordinates']` | `undefined`; no modifier override |
| `defaultCoordinates` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['defaultCoordinates']` | Computed from `defaultSize`, then `defaultPosition` |
| `defaultVisibleArea` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['defaultVisibleArea']` | Core `defaultVisibleArea` function |
| `areaPositionRestrictions` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['areaPositionRestrictions']` | Core `defaultAreaPositionRestrictions` function |
| `areaSizeRestrictions` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['areaSizeRestrictions']` | Core `defaultAreaSizeRestrictions` function |
| `sizeRestrictions` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['sizeRestrictions']` | Core `pixelsRestrictions` function |
| `positionRestrictions` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['positionRestrictions']` | Core `defaultPositionRestrictions` function |
| `aspectRatio` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['aspectRatio']` | Stencil ratio, otherwise unrestricted (`0` to `Infinity`) |
| `minWidth` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['minWidth']` | `undefined`; effective minimum `0` |
| `minHeight` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['minHeight']` | `undefined`; effective minimum `0` |
| `maxWidth` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['maxWidth']` | `undefined`; effective maximum `Infinity` |
| `maxHeight` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['maxHeight']` | `undefined`; effective maximum `Infinity` |
| `defaultSize` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['defaultSize']` | Core `defaultSize` function |
| `defaultPosition` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['defaultPosition']` | Core `defaultPosition` function |
| `defaultTransforms` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['defaultTransforms']` | `undefined`; image transforms on initialization |
| `imageRestriction` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['imageRestriction']` | `ImageRestriction.fitArea` |
| `priority` | `CropperSettingsInput<E>['priority']` | `undefined`; core `Priority.coordinates` |


## Algorithms and transitions

| Prop | Type | Default |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `transitions` | `CropperTransitionsSettings` \| `boolean` | `true`; duration `350`, timing `ease-in-out` |
| `postProcess` | `PostprocessFunction<CropperSettings<E>>` \| `PostprocessFunction<CropperSettings<E>>[]` | None |
| `setCoordinatesAlgorithm` | `SetCoordinatesAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `setVisibleAreaAlgorithm` | `SetVisibleAreaAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `setBoundaryAlgorithm` | `SetBoundaryAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `transformImageAlgorithm` | `TransformImageAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `moveCoordinatesAlgorithm` | `MoveAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `resizeCoordinatesAlgorithm` | `ResizeAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `createStateAlgorithm` | `CreateStateAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |
| `reconcileStateAlgorithm` | `ReconcileStateAlgorithm<CropperSettings<E>>` | `undefined` |


The eight algorithm props default to the corresponding core state modifier (`setCoordinates`, `setVisibleArea`, `setBoundary`, `transformImage`, `moveCoordinates`, `resizeCoordinates`, `createState`, `reconcileState`). `postProcess` runs configured functions after state operations.

## Callbacks

Every callback is optional, defaults to `undefined`, and has type `CropperCallback<E> = (cropper: CropperInstance<E>) => void`.

| Callback | Notification |
| --- | --- |
| `onReady` | Current image, rendered initialized state and enabled export source are ready. |
| `onError` | Image loading failed. |
| `onChange` | Crop geometry changes. |
| `onUpdate` | State, interactions, transitions or loading observations change. |
| `onMove`, `onMoveEnd` | Stencil movement and completion. |
| `onResize`, `onResizeEnd` | Stencil resize and completion. |
| `onTransformImage`, `onTransformImageEnd` | Image transformation and completion. |
| `onInteractionStart`, `onInteractionEnd` | Overall interaction lifetime. |
| `onTransitionsStart`, `onTransitionsEnd` | Transition lifetime. |

Callbacks run untracked while mounted. `onReady` is coalesced per displayed image; it is not emitted again for every reset. Clearing `src` clears pending loading, and stale asynchronous loads cannot commit after replacement or destruction.

## Snippets and context

The four layer signatures appear in the props table and [snippet contracts](/docs/reference/snippets). `children?: Snippet` selects stencil children; omitting it creates one rectangle stencil. Supplying empty children creates no stencil. This component provides isolated [CropperContext](/docs/reference/stencil-context) and requires no ancestor context.

## Instance and styling

`bind:this` exposes all [33 CropperInstance methods](/docs/reference/cropper-instance). Getters remain reactive; `disabled` prevents user gestures, not programmatic actions. `getCanvas()` returns `null` with export disabled.

The root is `.advanced-cropper`, with `--disabled`, `__boundary`, `__background-wrapper` and `__background` selectors. See the [complete styling contract](/docs/reference/styling).

## Loading and gesture options

`src` may be an image URL, data URL or application-owned object URL; `null` or an empty string clears it. `checkOrientation` reads EXIF orientation. `crossOrigin={true}` requests anonymous CORS, `false` omits the attribute, and the string values select their corresponding modes. `unloadTime` gives the previous image time to fade out before replacement. `canvas` enables the internal export canvas.

`moveImage` accepts `{ mouse?: boolean; touch?: boolean }`; `scaleImage` accepts `{ touch?: boolean; wheel?: boolean | { ratio?: number } }`; `rotateImage` accepts `{ touch?: boolean }`. A boolean enables or disables all gestures in that group. Omitted object fields are enabled; wheel ratio defaults to `0.1`. Rotation is disabled by the cropper default. `transformImage.adjustStencil` controls geometry during scaling, separately from input options.
